<template name="tus_settings_randomization_Machinedrum">
<head>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="settings-page">
		<h1>Random Trigs</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Chance that each step receives a trig when a random-trig chord fires (FUNCTION + DOWN for the selected track, FUNCTION + BANK GROUP or BANK GROUP + YES for every track). Double-click the slider to reset to 50 %. Saved with the plugin state, per instance.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div class="settings-hlayout">
			<input id="sliderTrigChance" class="settings-slider-h" type="range" min="1" max="99" step="1" value="50" style="width: 90%;"/>
			<label id="labelTrigChance">50 %</label>
		</div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div id="btGrooveMode" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>AFX / AE groove mode</label></div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Off: every step rolls the trig chance independently. On: each track gets a role (kick, snare, hats, toms, percussion, bass, lead, pad, arp) and its trigs follow classic electro and acid grammars: kicks on the one with syncopated pickups, backbeats with ghosts, offbeat hats, sparse toms with last-bar fills, 303-style bass phrasing. The trig chance slider then acts as overall density. On the Monomachine, notes follow the role too: root, fifth and octave for bass, stepwise walks for leads, chord tones for pads, in the chosen scale.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<h1>Protected From Value Randomization</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Ticked parameters keep their value when a random machine is assigned or YES + UP randomizes a page. Volume is never randomized. Untick to let one be randomized.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div id="pv0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Distortion (DIST)</label></div>
		<div id="pv1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Delay Send (DEL)</label></div>
		<div id="pv2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Reverb Send (REV)</label></div>
		<div id="pv3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>EQ Gain (EQG)</label></div>
		<div id="pv4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Filter Q (FLTQ)</label></div>
		<div id="pv5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Sample Rate Reduction (SRR)</label></div>
		<div id="pv6" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Amplitude Mod Depth (AMD)</label></div>
		<div id="pv7" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Pan (PAN)</label></div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<h1>Random Parameter Locks</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Chance that each trig receives a lock on a parameter picked for randomization. Applies to every lock chord: the current page, a single parameter, all tracks, and the everything chord. Double-click to reset to 50 %.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div class="settings-hlayout">
			<input id="sliderLockChance" class="settings-slider-h" type="range" min="1" max="99" step="1" value="50" style="width: 90%;"/>
			<label id="labelLockChance">50 %</label>
		</div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<h1>Protected From Parameter Locks</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Ticked parameters are never chosen for random parameter locks. Untick to allow locks on one.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div id="pl0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Distortion (DIST)</label></div>
		<div id="pl1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Delay Send (DEL)</label></div>
		<div id="pl2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Reverb Send (REV)</label></div>
		<div id="pl3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>EQ Gain (EQG)</label></div>
		<div id="pl4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Filter Q (FLTQ)</label></div>
		<div id="pl5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Sample Rate Reduction (SRR)</label></div>
		<div id="pl6" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Amplitude Mod Depth (AMD)</label></div>
		<div id="pl7" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Pan (PAN)</label></div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<h1>Include Tracks</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Untick a track to leave it out of the randomize gestures: its trigs, its machine, or its parameter locks. All tracks are included by default. Saved with the plugin state, so it travels with your DAW project.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<table class="settings-table">
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 1</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 2</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 3</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 4</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 5</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 6</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 7</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig6" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach6" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock6" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 8</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig7" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach7" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock7" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 9</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig8" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach8" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock8" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 10</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig9" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach9" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock9" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 11</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig10" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach10" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock10" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 12</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig11" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach11" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock11" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 13</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig12" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach12" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock12" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 14</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig13" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach13" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock13" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 15</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig14" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach14" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock14" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 16</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig15" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach15" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock15" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
		</table>
		<settingsspacer1/>
	</div>
</body>
</template>
